"Salaried staff are not covered by this page\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text directly states this restriction in the 'Who this is for' section.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-003\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Totals must be submitted by 12:00 on the 18th of the month\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text explicitly states this deadline in the 'Monthly cut-off' section.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-004\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"The 18th is a hard cut-off, not a target\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text directly describes the 18th as a hard cut-off in the 'Monthly cut-off' section.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-005\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"submissions that arrive after it are held for the following month's run\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"This is stated in the 'Monthly cut-off' section regarding what happens to late submissions.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-006\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"If the 18th falls on a weekend or a public holiday, the cut-off moves to the last working day before it\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text explicitly states this adjustment rule in the 'Monthly cut-off' section.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-007\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Submit one file per team\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text states this requirement in the 'What to submit' section.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-008\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"listing every hourly worker with hours and the cost centre the hours are charged to\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text specifies this content requirement in the 'What to submit' section.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-009\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Blank rows are rejected by the upload page\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text explicitly states this in the 'What to submit' section.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-010\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"A correction submitted before the cut-off replaces the earlier file entirely\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text directly states this in the 'Corrections' section.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-011\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"After the cut-off, corrections go to the payroll inbox as a written request\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text states this process in the 'Corrections' section.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-012\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"are applied to the following month\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text states post-cut-off corrections are applied to the following month.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-013\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"If the upload page is unavailable in the hour before the cut-off, email the payroll team\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text states this action in the 'Escalation' section.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-014\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"If the upload page is unavailable in the hour before the cut-off, email the payroll team and keep the file\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text states both actions in the 'Escalation' section when the upload page is unavailable.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-015\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Do not send totals in the body of an email\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text states this restriction in the 'Escalation' section with equivalent meaning.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-001\",\n      \"verdict\": \"CONTRADICTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Totals must be submitted by 12:00 on the 18th of the month\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference specifies 12:00 on the 18th, contradicting the claim's 15:00 on the 20th.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-002\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"submissions that arrive after it are held for the following month's run\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text states this about late submissions in the 'Monthly cut-off' section.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-003\",\n      \"verdict\": \"CONTRADICTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"If the 18th falls on a weekend or a public holiday, the cut-off moves to the last working day before it\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference specifies the cut-off moves to the last working day BEFORE the 18th, not the following Monday after the 20th.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-004\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Submit one file per team listing every hourly worker with hours and the cost centre the hours are charged to\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text states this exact requirement in the 'What to submit' section.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-005\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\":